1
00:01:11,360 --> 00:01:11,880
Mom.

2
00:01:40,440 --> 00:01:41,160
Mr. Wang.

3
00:01:42,920 --> 00:01:44,320
Is there anything wrong?

4
00:01:44,800 --> 00:01:46,160
I heard a noise in your room.

5
00:01:46,160 --> 00:01:47,289
Is everything okay?

6
00:01:50,039 --> 00:01:51,170
Everything is fine.

7
00:01:56,880 --> 00:01:57,920
Have you eaten?

8
00:02:00,320 --> 00:02:02,160
I haven't eaten yet. What about you?

9
00:02:02,160 --> 00:02:02,840
Me neither.

10
00:02:05,880 --> 00:02:07,680
Let me treat you to some skewers.

11
00:02:08,720 --> 00:02:09,240
Sure.

12
00:02:09,840 --> 00:02:11,680
Armed fugitive Teng Xiaohu,

13
00:02:11,680 --> 00:02:13,360
about 1.86 meters tall,

14
00:02:13,360 --> 00:02:14,280
thin build,

15
00:02:14,280 --> 00:02:15,480
with an injury on his left arm.

16
00:02:15,480 --> 00:02:17,560
Citizens are advised to take precautions.

17
00:02:17,560 --> 00:02:21,020
If you have any clues, please contact the police immediately.

18
00:02:21,280 --> 00:02:22,960
Armed fugitive Teng Xiaohu,

19
00:02:22,960 --> 00:02:24,000
height one...

20
00:02:29,200 --> 00:02:30,360
Who... Who is it?

21
00:02:31,480 --> 00:02:32,240
Who is it?

22
00:02:47,600 --> 00:02:48,200
Manman.

23
00:02:49,120 --> 00:02:50,650
Wh-What are you doing here?

24
00:02:53,760 --> 00:02:54,960
Go, go, go.

25
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:56,200
Leave.

26
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:06,130
What are you doing here?

27
00:03:06,240 --> 00:03:07,880
The police just searched the place today.

28
00:03:07,880 --> 00:03:08,920
They're looking for you all over Xinchun,

29
00:03:08,920 --> 00:03:10,650
and you still dare to come here?

30
00:03:10,680 --> 00:03:11,740
Can you just leave?

31
00:03:11,760 --> 00:03:13,760
Don't drag Mr. Song and me into this.

32
00:03:13,760 --> 00:03:14,440
Manman,

33
00:03:15,040 --> 00:03:16,400
the police are after me.

34
00:03:16,880 --> 00:03:19,079
I really had no choice but to come to you.

35
00:03:19,520 --> 00:03:20,250
Don't worry.

36
00:03:20,600 --> 00:03:21,600
I'll leave after a short while.

37
00:03:21,600 --> 00:03:23,440
I promise I won't cause you any trouble.

38
00:03:23,440 --> 00:03:24,760
Please have pity on me.

39
00:03:28,120 --> 00:03:29,040
You're hurt.

40
00:03:53,440 --> 00:03:54,120
Manman.

41
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:55,920
I knew

42
00:03:56,360 --> 00:03:58,560
you were the only one who cared about me.

43
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:06,240
Xiaoman, who is it?

44
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:07,800
Mr. Song.

45
00:04:07,800 --> 00:04:09,460
I'll go. You can keep working.

46
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:14,720
Hello.

47
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:16,860
We are from the Yanhe Police Station.

48
00:04:20,320 --> 00:04:21,519
Yes, there is a suspect.

49
00:04:21,519 --> 00:04:23,360
Teng Xiaohu is currently on the run.

50
00:04:23,360 --> 00:04:25,120
This person is quite dangerous.

51
00:04:25,120 --> 00:04:27,040
If you spot any suspicious individuals,

52
00:04:27,040 --> 00:04:28,680
contact our police station immediately.

53
00:04:28,680 --> 00:04:29,940
Don't worry, officer.

54
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:31,920
I'll report any news right away.

55
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:32,890
Okay.

56
00:04:33,200 --> 00:04:33,800
All right.

57
00:04:42,760 --> 00:04:43,320
Xiaoman.

58
00:04:46,440 --> 00:04:48,040
Was that the police just now?

59
00:04:48,120 --> 00:04:48,840
Yes.

60
00:04:50,159 --> 00:04:53,800
This Teng Xiaohu is really reckless.

61
00:04:54,159 --> 00:04:54,720
I heard

62
00:04:55,360 --> 00:04:57,560
he even resisted arrest with a gun.

63
00:04:59,040 --> 00:05:00,400
He gets worse as he grows older.

64
00:05:00,400 --> 00:05:01,280
I'm afraid even God

65
00:05:01,280 --> 00:05:02,540
can't control him now.

66
00:05:04,480 --> 00:05:05,040
Xiaoman.

67
00:05:06,000 --> 00:05:07,520
What's wrong? You look terrible.

68
00:05:07,520 --> 00:05:08,650
Did you catch a cold?

69
00:05:09,120 --> 00:05:10,840
I'm just a little sleepy, Mr. Song.

70
00:05:10,840 --> 00:05:12,440
Why don't you go to bed early?

71
00:05:15,680 --> 00:05:16,520
Just now,

72
00:05:16,920 --> 00:05:18,780
were you preparing the medicine?

73
00:05:19,680 --> 00:05:20,120
Yes.

74
00:05:20,280 --> 00:05:21,440
The new medicine arrives tomorrow,

75
00:05:21,440 --> 00:05:23,240
so I'm sorting it out in advance.

76
00:05:25,040 --> 00:05:26,770
You heard what the police said.

77
00:05:27,920 --> 00:05:28,840
Back then,

78
00:05:28,840 --> 00:05:30,770
I was right to make you two break up.

79
00:05:31,600 --> 00:05:32,600
This Teng Xiaohu,

80
00:05:32,840 --> 00:05:34,440
he's no good.

81
00:05:35,159 --> 00:05:35,720
He

82
00:05:36,080 --> 00:05:37,940
is up to no good at such a young age.

83
00:05:38,440 --> 00:05:39,280
So,

84
00:05:39,480 --> 00:05:40,960
since you've broken up with him,

85
00:05:40,960 --> 00:05:42,760
you must cut ties completely, understand?

86
00:05:42,760 --> 00:05:43,760
Don't worry, Mr. Song.

87
00:05:43,760 --> 00:05:45,960
We haven't been in touch for a long time.

88
00:05:46,840 --> 00:05:47,360
Good.

89
00:05:49,480 --> 00:05:50,480
I'll go rest then.

90
00:05:50,640 --> 00:05:51,240
Okay.

91
00:05:51,360 --> 00:05:54,159
Rest early after you finish sorting the medicine.

92
00:06:26,200 --> 00:06:27,480
There's an

93
00:06:27,680 --> 00:06:28,360
empty room in the backyard.

94
00:06:28,360 --> 00:06:30,480
No one knows about it except Mr. Song and me.

95
00:06:30,480 --> 00:06:31,840
You can stay there for a couple of days.

96
00:06:31,840 --> 00:06:32,840
Remember, without my permission,

97
00:06:32,840 --> 00:06:34,520
you are not allowed to come out or make a sound.

98
00:06:34,520 --> 00:06:35,040
Okay.

99
00:06:35,360 --> 00:06:37,090
I'll bring you some food later.

100
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:39,530
I'll come pick you up later.

101
00:06:49,360 --> 00:06:50,000
Hello.

102
00:06:50,600 --> 00:06:51,159
Mr. Wang.

103
00:06:51,280 --> 00:06:52,640
It's me, Chen Lu.

104
00:06:54,040 --> 00:06:55,970
Sorry to disturb you and your wife.

105
00:06:57,080 --> 00:06:57,760
Well...

106
00:06:58,640 --> 00:06:59,640
I'm also anxious.

107
00:06:59,760 --> 00:07:00,560
Yes.

108
00:07:01,320 --> 00:07:02,850
I know it's hard for you too.

109
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:05,060
Can you spare me a batch of birch wood?

110
00:07:05,640 --> 00:07:07,440
Second-grade material is fine.

111
00:07:08,320 --> 00:07:08,880
Then...

112
00:07:10,880 --> 00:07:11,400
Hello?

113
00:07:13,440 --> 00:07:13,960
Hello?

114
00:07:15,720 --> 00:07:16,280
Mom.

115
00:07:18,200 --> 00:07:19,000
Stop calling.

116
00:07:19,120 --> 00:07:20,400
You've been calling all night.

117
00:07:20,400 --> 00:07:21,480
Did anyone answer?

118
00:07:21,840 --> 00:07:22,600
Even if they answered,

119
00:07:22,600 --> 00:07:23,760
who would help?

120
00:07:24,160 --> 00:07:26,960
It's obvious someone is deliberately making things difficult for us.

121
00:07:26,960 --> 00:07:28,640
How would I know if I don't call?

122
00:07:28,640 --> 00:07:30,440
What if someone remembers our old friendship?

123
00:07:30,440 --> 00:07:32,240
I have to figure something out.

124
00:07:32,400 --> 00:07:33,680
I can't just sell this factory

125
00:07:33,680 --> 00:07:35,210
and let the two of us starve.

126
00:07:35,280 --> 00:07:37,480
These people are just playing dumb.

127
00:07:39,360 --> 00:07:41,420
Begging them is completely useless.

128
00:07:42,400 --> 00:07:43,600
You know everything.

129
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:45,800
There's nothing you don't know.

130
00:07:46,720 --> 00:07:47,440
This has nothing to do with you.

131
00:07:47,440 --> 00:07:48,400
Hurry up and go to sleep.

132
00:07:48,400 --> 00:07:49,159
I won't.

133
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:50,720
Go to sleep.

134
00:07:51,960 --> 00:07:53,890
You don't need to worry about this.

135
00:08:11,960 --> 00:08:12,640
Mr. Wang,

136
00:08:13,480 --> 00:08:15,840
did you see anything in the woods that day?

137
00:08:17,120 --> 00:08:19,580
What do you mean by seeing anything, Miss Li?

138
00:08:22,320 --> 00:08:23,560
I'm just asking casually.

139
00:08:23,560 --> 00:08:25,160
Don't take it too seriously.

140
00:08:35,120 --> 00:08:37,919
Do you have a good relationship with your parents?

141
00:08:38,799 --> 00:08:39,400
It's okay.

142
00:08:40,799 --> 00:08:42,130
What about your mother?

143
00:08:45,840 --> 00:08:47,770
She is the best mother in the world.

144
00:08:51,160 --> 00:08:51,760
Yes.

145
00:08:53,840 --> 00:08:55,900
There are no bad mothers in the world.

146
00:09:13,080 --> 00:09:13,920
Miss Li.

147
00:09:15,120 --> 00:09:17,520
You've had too much to drink. Let's go back.

148
00:09:28,280 --> 00:09:28,840
Let's go.

149
00:09:29,160 --> 00:09:29,960
Let's go back.

150
00:09:30,960 --> 00:09:31,640
Put it back.

151
00:09:38,120 --> 00:09:38,680
Hey, man.

152
00:09:39,120 --> 00:09:40,040
Your girlfriend had too much to drink.

153
00:09:40,040 --> 00:09:40,960
Need any help?

154
00:09:40,960 --> 00:09:41,760
No, thanks.

155
00:09:42,680 --> 00:09:43,240
Okay, take care.

156
00:09:43,240 --> 00:09:43,920
Mom.

157
00:09:44,800 --> 00:09:46,400
Mom, why aren't you leaving?

158
00:10:06,440 --> 00:10:07,570
Hello, Officer Cao.

159
00:10:10,040 --> 00:10:11,300
You're looking for me?

160
00:10:12,280 --> 00:10:12,960
Now?

161
00:10:15,840 --> 00:10:16,400
Okay.

162
00:10:17,000 --> 00:10:18,600
I'll be there in half an hour.

163
00:10:36,400 --> 00:10:37,200
You're awake.

164
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:44,000
Why am I here?

165
00:10:44,800 --> 00:10:46,280
You drank too much last night

166
00:10:46,280 --> 00:10:47,880
and wouldn't give me your room card,

167
00:10:47,880 --> 00:10:49,410
so I had to put you in my room.

168
00:10:53,440 --> 00:10:54,320
I'm sorry.

169
00:10:54,640 --> 00:10:56,680
I caused you trouble, didn't I?

170
00:10:58,200 --> 00:10:58,800
It's fine.

171
00:10:59,520 --> 00:11:00,560
Officer Cao is looking for me.

172
00:11:00,560 --> 00:11:01,240
I need to go.

173
00:11:01,840 --> 00:11:02,680
You...

174
00:11:03,120 --> 00:11:04,450
Is it about Teng Xiaohu?

175
00:11:04,960 --> 00:11:06,120
I'll go with you.

176
00:11:06,120 --> 00:11:06,720
No need.

177
00:11:07,120 --> 00:11:08,920
I'll call you if I need anything.

178
00:11:10,320 --> 00:11:11,120
That works.

179
00:11:12,920 --> 00:11:14,180
Take some time to rest.

180
00:11:14,760 --> 00:11:15,640
Rest a bit.

181
00:11:18,840 --> 00:11:19,970
Take care, Mr. Wang.

182
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:32,760
Mr. Wang.

183
00:11:34,400 --> 00:11:36,060
I don't have any good tea here,

184
00:11:36,440 --> 00:11:37,520
so just make do with this.

185
00:11:37,520 --> 00:11:38,120
Thank you.

186
00:11:43,040 --> 00:11:44,480
At the Beishan Hunting Ground,

187
00:11:44,480 --> 00:11:45,600
you weren't hurt, were you?

188
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:46,080
No.

189
00:11:47,440 --> 00:11:48,500
There's something

190
00:11:48,640 --> 00:11:50,500
I still need to tell you, Mr. Wang.

191
00:11:50,560 --> 00:11:52,220
Please go ahead, Officer Cao.

192
00:11:52,320 --> 00:11:53,600
It feels like you

193
00:11:53,960 --> 00:11:55,820
don't get along with our Xinchun.

194
00:11:56,000 --> 00:11:57,480
You've only been here a few days,

195
00:11:57,480 --> 00:11:58,920
your business deal fell through,

196
00:11:58,920 --> 00:12:00,640
and now you've run into a murder case.

197
00:12:00,640 --> 00:12:01,840
You really need to be careful.

198
00:12:01,840 --> 00:12:03,760
Thank you for your concern, Officer Cao.

199
00:12:03,760 --> 00:12:04,440
But,

200
00:12:04,440 --> 00:12:06,370
did you call me here just to warn me?

201
00:12:06,520 --> 00:12:07,400
Not exactly.

202
00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:09,480
I mainly want to know

203
00:12:10,120 --> 00:12:12,160
about what happened at the Beishan Hunting Ground yesterday.

204
00:12:12,160 --> 00:12:14,360
How is it that after only a few days here,

205
00:12:14,520 --> 00:12:16,920
you ended up in a gunfight with Teng Xiaohu?

206
00:12:17,640 --> 00:12:20,440
Yesterday was my fourth time meeting Teng Xiaohu.

207
00:12:21,560 --> 00:12:24,290
Our previous meetings weren't pleasant either.

208
00:12:24,720 --> 00:12:26,320
The day I arrived in Xinchun,

209
00:12:26,320 --> 00:12:27,650
which was the day we met,

210
00:12:28,240 --> 00:12:31,240
Teng Xiaohu stopped the car Boss Lin sent to pick me up.

211
00:12:31,400 --> 00:12:32,160
Later,

212
00:12:32,400 --> 00:12:34,660
Boss Li invited me to dinner at his house,

213
00:12:34,680 --> 00:12:36,480
and Teng Xiaohu showed up uninvited

214
00:12:36,480 --> 00:12:38,280
to invite me to the Beishan Hunting Ground.

215
00:12:38,280 --> 00:12:39,740
Knowing it was dangerous,

216
00:12:40,080 --> 00:12:41,340
why didn't you refuse?

217
00:12:42,480 --> 00:12:43,210
Officer Cao,

218
00:12:44,360 --> 00:12:45,560
I'm a businessman.

219
00:12:46,560 --> 00:12:47,600
For businessmen,

220
00:12:47,760 --> 00:12:48,680
there are no permanent enemies,

221
00:12:48,680 --> 00:12:50,140
and no permanent friends.

222
00:12:51,080 --> 00:12:52,810
I came to Xinchun to buy timber.

223
00:12:54,240 --> 00:12:55,080
I thought

224
00:12:55,080 --> 00:12:57,240
Boss Teng's processing plant wanted to cooperate with me,

225
00:12:57,240 --> 00:12:58,040
so I went.

226
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:01,000
That makes sense.

227
00:13:02,200 --> 00:13:02,880
Mr. Wang,

228
00:13:03,760 --> 00:13:05,440
You continued staying at the hotel

229
00:13:05,440 --> 00:13:07,520
even after someone died there,

230
00:13:07,840 --> 00:13:09,560
and you dared to go to the meeting

231
00:13:09,560 --> 00:13:10,760
knowing it was a trap.

232
00:13:11,080 --> 00:13:12,640
Should I say you're brave,

233
00:13:12,880 --> 00:13:14,080
or just careless?

234
00:13:14,760 --> 00:13:17,120
That depends on what you think, Officer Cao.

235
00:13:17,120 --> 00:13:18,580
What's your relationship

236
00:13:18,680 --> 00:13:19,540
with Li Xuefei?

237
00:13:19,800 --> 00:13:20,560
New friends.

238
00:13:20,960 --> 00:13:21,800
New friends?

239
00:13:23,160 --> 00:13:26,360
Then the person who picked you up in a tricycle yesterday,

240
00:13:26,520 --> 00:13:27,580
is he also a friend?

241
00:13:28,200 --> 00:13:30,000
If you're willing, Officer Cao,

242
00:13:30,080 --> 00:13:31,280
we can be friends too.

243
00:13:48,440 --> 00:13:49,040
Xiaolong.

244
00:13:51,720 --> 00:13:52,360
Xiaopao.

245
00:13:53,000 --> 00:13:54,040
This is your brother Xiaolong.

246
00:13:54,040 --> 00:13:55,100
For the time being,

247
00:13:55,120 --> 00:13:56,440
he'll be staying at our house.

248
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:57,640
Take good care of him.

249
00:13:59,400 --> 00:14:00,930
What's wrong with his eyes?

250
00:14:02,160 --> 00:14:02,800
Xiaopao.

251
00:14:03,520 --> 00:14:04,780
Everyone in this world

252
00:14:04,800 --> 00:14:06,600
has their own characteristics.

253
00:14:06,600 --> 00:14:07,400
Just like you,

254
00:14:07,520 --> 00:14:08,360
you run fast.

255
00:14:08,880 --> 00:14:10,210
That's your specialty.

256
00:14:10,680 --> 00:14:11,200
Well...

257
00:14:11,560 --> 00:14:14,960
His eyes are also a characteristic of your brother Xiaolong.

258
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:15,800
Go say hi.

259
00:14:16,520 --> 00:14:17,160
Just like

260
00:14:17,400 --> 00:14:18,600
brother Gecko,

261
00:14:18,800 --> 00:14:20,200
who can climb very, very high?

262
00:14:20,200 --> 00:14:21,260
That's what I mean.

263
00:14:21,640 --> 00:14:22,320
Go, go on.

264
00:14:22,960 --> 00:14:24,160
Entertain our guest.

265
00:14:29,320 --> 00:14:29,760
Dad.

266
00:14:30,720 --> 00:14:32,650
What is he wearing around his neck?

267
00:14:33,440 --> 00:14:34,640
Come here. Come here.

268
00:14:35,440 --> 00:14:37,040
That might be something Xiaolong's parents

269
00:14:37,040 --> 00:14:37,960
left for him.

270
00:14:38,360 --> 00:14:40,320
How could you just go up and look at it?

271
00:14:40,320 --> 00:14:41,320
Stingy.

272
00:14:41,400 --> 00:14:42,040
He won't even let me look.

273
00:14:42,040 --> 00:14:43,120
I'm not playing with him anymore.

274
00:14:43,120 --> 00:14:43,560
You.

275
00:14:53,440 --> 00:14:54,040
Mr. Wang.

276
00:14:56,800 --> 00:14:57,880
I understand

277
00:14:58,520 --> 00:14:59,720
the basic situation.

278
00:14:59,920 --> 00:15:02,160
I'll contact you if I need anything else.

279
00:15:02,160 --> 00:15:02,760
Of course,

280
00:15:02,800 --> 00:15:04,160
if you think of anything,

281
00:15:04,160 --> 00:15:05,490
you can also contact me.

282
00:15:05,920 --> 00:15:06,400
Okay.

283
00:15:06,840 --> 00:15:08,040
I assume you've heard

284
00:15:08,720 --> 00:15:10,380
about Zhou Guangfu, Mr. Wang.

285
00:15:12,080 --> 00:15:13,200
Please stay safe.

286
00:15:13,640 --> 00:15:14,960
If you're in any danger,

287
00:15:14,960 --> 00:15:16,160
call me immediately.

288
00:15:16,720 --> 00:15:17,760
Zhou Guangfu.

289
00:15:18,920 --> 00:15:20,560
We met once before.

290
00:15:20,960 --> 00:15:21,890
It's such a pity.

291
00:15:22,880 --> 00:15:25,320
But with good police officers like you in Xinchun,

292
00:15:25,320 --> 00:15:27,650
I believe the culprit will be caught soon.

293
00:15:28,760 --> 00:15:29,560
I hope so.

294
00:15:30,400 --> 00:15:31,460
I'll be going then.

295
00:15:32,240 --> 00:15:32,840
Take care.

296
00:15:36,360 --> 00:15:37,160
Mr. Wang.

297
00:15:40,240 --> 00:15:42,770
There's one more question I didn't get to ask.

298
00:15:44,600 --> 00:15:46,600
Have you always been in Jiangcheng?

299
00:15:46,800 --> 00:15:47,400
Yes.

300
00:15:48,280 --> 00:15:49,940
That's really a coincidence.

301
00:15:51,560 --> 00:15:53,420
In the deceased Liu Ming's phone,

302
00:15:53,680 --> 00:15:55,040
there is a phone number

303
00:15:55,200 --> 00:15:56,200
from Jiangcheng.

304
00:16:01,760 --> 00:16:02,360
Mr. Wang.

305
00:16:03,600 --> 00:16:05,330
Could you help me analyze this?

306
00:16:07,640 --> 00:16:08,370
Officer Cao.

307
00:16:09,240 --> 00:16:10,440
Jiangcheng is so big.

308
00:16:10,440 --> 00:16:11,840
With just a phone number,

309
00:16:12,280 --> 00:16:13,440
I'm afraid I can't help you.
